untested_model.description:
This integration has only been tested with the models listed in the README. For “{model}” it shows weight, heart rate and impedances as long as the scale speaks the same protocol. Body values (body fat, muscle mass …) are not calculated, because other models may use different calibration factors and the results could be wrong.

If you want to try it anyway: Settings → Devices & services → Unique Health Scale → Configure → Assignment and question → “Calculate body values for an untested scale”. Then compare the values with the app.

Please report whether it works, so the model can be added to the list: {url}
